  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Modernization of Vietnamese Agriculture: Technological Innovation Projects for Building Smart Farms and Enhancing High-Tech Agricultural Capabilities for Small and Medium-sized Farms</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establish an AI-based smart farm solution in Vietnam capable of cultivating high-value crops to enhance the expertise of local small and medium sized farmers through specialized training programs and smart farm operations, fostering high-tech agricultural professionals and securing market competitiveness</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to establish an AI-based smart farm solution in Vietnam for cultivating high-value crops, such as strawberries. The project intends to enhance the capabilities of local small and medium-sized farmers through expert capacity-building programs and smart farm operations. Additionally, it seeks to train high-tech agricultural specialists and secure market competitiveness.- &#xace0;&#xbd80;&#xac00;&#xac00;&#xce58; &#xc791;&#xbb3c;(&#xb538;&#xae30;) &#xc7ac;&#xbc30;&#xac00; &#xac00;&#xb2a5;&#xd55c; &#xc778;&#xacf5;&#xc9c0;&#xb2a5; &#xae30;&#xbc18; &#xc2a4;&#xb9c8;&#xd2b8;&#xd31c; &#xc2dc;&#xc124; &#xbc0f; &#xc194;&#xb8e8;&#xc158; &#xad6c;&#xcd95; &#xbc0f; &#xc6b4;&#xc601;  
